EarnestStateCampus_Dorm_1F_ARHU_Text_ResidentAdvisor:
	.string "I'm the RESIDENT ADVISOR for this\n"
	.string "hall. Welcome!\p"
	.string "Rule one: quiet hours start at ten.\n"
	.string "That includes your POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Rule two: no using SURF in the\n"
	.string "showers. We learned that one the\l"
	.string "hard way.$"

EarnestStateCampus_Dorm_1F_ARHU_Text_NightOwl:
	.string "I pulled an all-nighter on a paper\n"
	.string "about HOOTHOOT.\p"
	.string "It always stands on one foot, and\n"
	.string "switches feet so fast you can\l"
	.string "barely see it move!$"

EarnestStateCampus_Dorm_1F_ARHU_Text_Baker:
	.string "I'm baking POKéBLOCK treats for\n"
	.string "the whole floor.\p"
	.string "My SWINUB keeps nosing into the\n"
	.string "pantry, though. It digs up food\l"
	.string "with its snout!$"

EarnestStateCampus_Dorm_1F_ARHU_Text_Fridge:
	.string "A shared fridge. Everything inside\n"
	.string "is labeled.\p"
	.string "“MOOMOO MILK. PROPERTY OF DANA.\n"
	.string "DO NOT DRINK. I'M SERIOUS.”$"
